OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 21, dies in crash following
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old woman has died at the
OL,7,Fscene of a crash in Staffordshire
OL,8,Ffollowing a police pursuit.
OL,10,FThe front-seat passenger was pronounced
OL,11,Fdead at the scene on Rugeley Road in
OL,12,FHednesford just after 23:00 GMT, police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FStaffordshire Police confirmed the
OL,16,Fcrash, between a Seat Ibiza and a
OL,17,FVauxhall Astra being driven by members
OL,18,Fof the public, followed a short police
OL,19,Fpursuit involving a police vehicle and
OL,20,Fthe Seat.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
