OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 21, dies in crash following
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man from the Walsall area
OL,7,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fcausing death by dangerous driving,
OL,9,Fwhile the Astra driver is helping with
OL,10,Fpolice inquiries, the force said.
